<title>USA: Duke Realty to split stock, raise dividend.</title>
<headline>Duke Realty to split stock, raise dividend.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Duke Realty Investments Inc said Thursday that its board of directors declared a two-for-one stock split in the form of a 100 percent stock dividend on its common stock.</p>
<p>The company also said that the board anticipates the real estate firm's regular quarterly dividend amount to be $0.30 per common share on a post-split basis, a dividend increase of 1.7 percent.  </p>
<p>The official declaration for this new dividend is expected to be on October 23, 1997, the company said.</p>
<p>The stock dividend will be payable August 25, 1997 to shareholders of record on August 18, 1997.</p>
<p>Duke Realty shares were up 7/16 at 44-11/16</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
